id: DRAFT-tabixpp-1.1.2-install-shim-copy-cli-test-hardening
trigger_tool: make|conan|test
phase: build|package|testing
error_signature: make: .*\[Makefile:.*install\] Error 64|FATAL - bgzip compression failed
severity: 3
category: build-system, testing, ohos, platform
match_keywords: hmbs_platform_capabilities, install_shim, hmbs_upstream_test_result, bgzip, tbx_index_build
title: 上游Makefile多源install被install_shim拒绝时改用copy直拷与CLI上游测试加固
root_cause: 上游Makefile install目标多源install -c形式不被HarmonyOS install垫片支持而报Error 64；并存上游CLI测试诊断被&&吞掉、缺LD_LIBRARY_PATH与未自签，以及test_package隐式依赖远端包未提供的bgzip/tabix CLI
verification_cmd: 真机package()无Error 64；HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT保持status passed/discovered 1/executed 1；test_package 8断言口径不变全过；HMBS_PLATFORM_CAPABILITIES记录install_shim=true备查
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: copy-replace-install-plus-cli-hardening
rec_description: 删除package()中make install调用改用conan copy()复刻上游同布局并复用自签；同步加固_run_upstream_test常显日志+LD_LIBRARY_PATH+自签+非零判failed；test_package夹具改用BGZF/tbx C API现场生成
affected_scope: raw Makefile且install用多源install -c、install_shim=true的HarmonyOS适配配方；build()内直接执行新构建CLI做上游测试且链接外部共享库的场景；需现场生成bgzf+tbi夹具的htslib消费者测试
rec_command: conanfile.py: package()用copy()复制tabix++、*.hpp、libtabix.a、libtabix.so*与LICENSE到bin/include/lib/licenses并_sign_binary自签；_run_upstream_test用; rc=$?; cat; exit $rc并注入_dep_libdirs到LD_LIBRARY_PATH；test_package/test_tabixpp.cpp用bgzf_open/bgzf_write/tbx_index_build替代std::system bgzip
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: patch-makefile-install-target
fallback_description: 若必须保留make install则补丁拆分多源install为单源调用并规避mkdir/strip差异，仍保留copy直拷为首选
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: make: .*\[Makefile:.*install\] Error 64|install -c libtabix\.a
forbid_1_reason: 禁止沿用上游多源install -c/make install；垫片拒绝必然复现，必须改copy直拷
forbid_1_consequence: 真机package()复现Error 64/ConanException Error 2，任务退回修复循环
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-tabixpp-1.1.2-install-shim-copy-cli-test-hardening.md
last_updated: 2026-09-26
source_event: tabixpp/1.1.2 真机预检install_shim Error 64与CLI测试加固全部门禁通过
_dlrow: hmbs-executor
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 12791
